WEBVTT

title
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.600
Move Your Butt
Online team party game · Unity · Editor gameplay capture

1
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:15.350
Creators strike a pose and push into the moving wall to carve an opening.

2
00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:27.350
Passers then have to fit through the opening the other team carved.

3
00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:34.350 line:8%
A radial menu switches poses; the pose decides the shape that gets carved.

4
00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:41.950 line:8%
Later rounds add cannon volleys aimed at the passing team: rings warn of a blast or ice hit.

5
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.950 line:8%
Food cans land on each team's mat and refuel the jump/flight meter (bottom left).

6
00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:52.950 line:8%
A blast shoves the player off position just before the wall arrives.

7
00:00:53.150 --> 00:01:02.650
Final round (20 of 20).

8
00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.150
Match result after 20 rounds. In this capture one player faces a bot-filled team.

